@startuml
title Farm Management System State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Login

state "Login" as Login
state "Main Area" as MainArea
state "Market Conditions" as MarketConditions
state "Market Report" as MarketReport
state "Pest Control Help" as PestControlHelp
state "Pest Control Techniques" as PestControlTechniques
state "Soil Suggestions" as SoilSuggestions
state "Weather Insights" as WeatherInsights
state "Labour Availability" as LabourAvailability

Login --> MainArea : Successful Login / Display Main Area

MainArea --> MarketConditions : Select Market Conditions / Show Market Conditions
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : Select Market Report / Show Market Report

MainArea --> PestControlHelp : Select Pest Control Help / Request Photo
PestControlHelp --> PestControlTechniques : Provide Photo / Show Pest Control Techniques

MainArea --> SoilSuggestions : Receive Soil Information / Provide Soil Suggestions
SoilSuggestions --> MainArea : Continue Using Service / Return to Main Area

MainArea --> WeatherInsights : Provide Location / Offer Weather Insights
WeatherInsights --> MainArea : Continue Using Service / Return to Main Area

MainArea --> LabourAvailability : Provide Location / Display Labour Availability
LabourAvailability --> MainArea : Continue Using Service / Return to Main Area

MainArea --> Logout : Log Out / End Session

@enduml
